  "content": {
    "title": "毕业生必看：2014年求职就业新现象",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2014-05-15",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">毕业生必看：2014年求职就业新现象</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:    发布时间:2014-5-15 0:00:00</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 29px; text-decoration: none;\">毕业生必看：</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 29px; text-decoration: none;\">2014</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 29px; text-decoration: none;\">年求职就业新现象</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">文章来源：<span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">源深圳人才网</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">www.0755rc.com </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　来自教育部、人力资源和社会保障部等公布的数据显示，从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2005</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">年至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2014</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">年，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">年间全国普通高校毕业生从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">338</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">万人增长至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">727</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">万人，总数翻了一番</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">还要多。我国每年新进入市场的劳动者大约</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">1500</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">万人，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">727</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">万人差不多占到一半了。综合考虑，优简历网认为，今年大学生就业形势不容乐观。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　近</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">成海归首份工作月薪不足</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">千</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　近几年，国外就业环境愈发严峻，大批量海归回潮，另外，留学人员留学目的不一，素质参差不齐，导致海归群体整体“光环”渐退。相关数据显示，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">36.5%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">的</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">海归回国后的第一份工作，年薪起薪不足</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">万元，</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">67.2%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">起薪不足</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">万元。不少海归大呼“就业难”。从企业能提供的薪水来看，海归在他们眼中，不再是需要</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">用高薪来争取的“宝贝”。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　毕业生求职十大理想城市</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\">　　<span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2014</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">年应届本科毕业生就业观调查显示：在受访者心中，理想工作城市已经发生了变化。前十位的城市分别是上海（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">21.4%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、北京（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">13.4%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、南京</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">5.9%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、天津（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">5.0%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、苏州（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">4.6%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、青岛（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">4.4%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、杭州（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">3.4%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、深圳（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">3.2%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、西安（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2.7%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）、成都（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2.5%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）和大连</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2.5%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）。共占比</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">69%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　广州（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2.3%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）和厦门（</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">1.7%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">）位列第</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">和第</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">，其余</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">26.9%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">的受访者选择了自己的家乡城市。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　微信、微博、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">APP</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">“微求职”兴起</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　除了传统的现场招聘会和招聘网，微博、微信、</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">APP</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">软件正逐渐成为新的求职方式，这些微渠道对求职者而言多了低成本的求职选择。不过，因为招聘门槛低，优</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">简历网提醒求职者，“微求职”时要注意甄别求职陷阱和个人信息保护。不过从和求职者的聊天中发现，“微招聘”、“微求职”的求职成功率不高，多数简历都是</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">石沉大海。因此需要大家优化好自己的简历哦，可以来优简历网给自己的简历免费评测下。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　高校十大专业就业差距悬殊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　在本科专业中，有十大专业是招生大户，包括英语、法学、会计学、汉语言文学、国际经济与贸易、艺术设计、土木工程、电气工程及其自动化、机械设计制造及其</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">自动化、计算机科学与技术。但招生大户的专业在就业时未必“适销对路”，第三方调查机构麦可思日前的调查发现，上述十大专业的就业差距悬殊。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2013</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">届毕业生半年后的就业率来看，会计学和土木工程专业较高，分别为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">94.0%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">93.9%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">；而法学和艺术设计专业处于相对弱势，分别为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">86.3% </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">89.1%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">。从工作与专业相关度来看，土木工程专业从事相关工作的毕业生比例较高，为</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">93%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">，其次是会计学</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">(86%)</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">；而国际经济与贸易和法学专业毕业</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">生较难做到“学有所用”，分别只有</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">56%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">和</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">59%</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">的毕业生从事的工作与专业相关。</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　我国出台支持创业就业税收新政策</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">　　中国财政部、国家税务总局、人力资源和社会保障部于</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">29</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">日联合下发未来三年支持创业就业税收政策，其中失业人员自主创业每户每年可最高减税</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">9600 </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">元，企业每吸纳一名失业人员就业每年可最高减税</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">5200</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">元。此次新出台的政策主要从鼓励自主创业和吸纳就业两方面给予税收优惠，将现行政策优惠期延长三年</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">至</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">年</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">12</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">31</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">日，并扩大了受益人群范围，取消了行业限制，并加大了减税力度。为了你更好的求职，特推荐优简历网</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> www.ujianli.com</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">，国内首款以</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">HR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">角度制作简历的工具，智能匹配简历模板，免费评测简历，帮你完成一份符合</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">HR</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">要求的好简历！</span></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">本网原创文章未经本网允许</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">私自转2014载者本网保留追究其版权责任的权利</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">,</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\">转载请注明来源深圳人才网</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none;\"> www.0755rc.com</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <td>\n                        &nbsp;\n                    </td>\n                    <td width=\"90%\" height=\"23\" align=\"left\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\">\n                        \n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </div>\n                    ",
